## 12. Current Prototype Boundaries

The current architecture demonstrates:

* Real temperature sensing
* Real humidity sensing
* Real ESP32 processing
* Real THI calculation
* Real rule-based classification
* Real RGB indication
* Real buzzer alert
* Working dashboard prototype

The following are not currently represented as fully validated hardware capabilities:

* Physical GPS tracking
* Reliable live GSM/SMS delivery
* Machine-learning-based prediction
* Long-term field deployment

These areas form part of the future development roadmap.

